<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Jan unemployment rate rises to 5.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Swiss Jan unemployment rate rises to 5.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.7 percent in January, up from December's 5.3 percent, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					 Jan 1997    Dec 1996   Jan 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed	5.7	  5.3	  4.5</p>
<p> Number of jobless		 205,501    192,171    164,656</p>
<p> Job vacancies			 5,794	4,488	4,646</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
